      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You are tied strongly to Azoph-met, giving your Cazic-fer form a goatlike appearance. Knowledge of ancient bloody pasts and a desire for balance – whatever that means to you – hounds your inner thoughts. You are trained in Occultism and Lore about a type of Fiends or Celestials of your choice, typically one you frequently see in your thoughts. If you would already be trained in Occultism you become trained in a skill of your choice. You gain the Schooled in Secrets skill feat.</span></p>"
